THUG2 content pipeline - licensing

1. Material from the games (no licence granted)

   Not covered by the MIT licence below, and not owned by this project:
   - the adapted game scripts in menu_level/make_menu_level.ts and menu_level/career_complete.ts, which are modified
     from Tony Hawk's Underground 2's own scripts;
   - facts about the games and about THUGPRO's levels recorded in compat/ and in the converters' tables (names,
     checksums, coordinates, offsets);
   - anything these tools produce from your game files (converted levels, scripts, textures, the data overlay): that
     output is derived from the games, whose copyright belongs to Activision Publishing, Inc. and its licensors.

2. Original work (MIT licence)

   Everything else - the code written for this project - is licensed under the MIT licence below. Third-party parts
   keep their own licences: the fonts in fonts/ (SIL Open Font License) and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

